[2026-03-14T19:51:58.947Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0137Liwb2twJhXf1rTLqRp67","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me provide a comprehensive report of all the content I've found.\n\n## AirbnbClone App - Complete Structure and Content Report\n\n### Directory Structure\n- **App Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n- **Pages:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/` (7 pages)\n- **Components:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/` (33 components)\n- **Redux Slices:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/` (9 slices)\n\n---\n\n### FILES CONTENT\n\n#### **AppSpec.md** (Complete)\nA comprehensive vacation rental marketplace specification including:\n- **Overview:** Property listings, search, filtering, booking system, user profiles, reviews, and host dashboard\n- **Data Model:** Detailed schema for Users, Properties, Property Images, Amenities, Property Amenities (join table), Bookings, Reviews, and Favorites\n- **Pages (7 pages):**\n  1. Login / Register (`/login`) - Email-based auth\n  2. Home / Search (`/`) - Search bar, category filter, property grid, filters panel, pagination\n  3. Property Detail (`/properties/:id`) - Gallery, header, info, description, amenities, booking card, reviews, host info\n  4. My Trips (`/trips`) - Upcoming/Past/Cancelled tabs, trip cards, cancellation, write review\n  5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`) - Stats, listings tab, bookings tab, add listing form\n  6. User Profile (`/profile`) - View/edit profile, become host, user reviews\n  7. Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`) - Rating sliders, comment, submit\n- **API Endpoints:** 40+ endpoints across Auth, Users, Properties, Property Images, Bookings, Reviews, Favorites, and Amenities\n- **Visual Design:** Coral/red accent (#FF5A5F), responsive grid (1 col mobile, 2 tablet, 3-4 desktop), status badges with color codes\n\n#### **docs/tests.md** (Partial - 25,000 token limit reached)\nComprehensive Playwright test specifications covering:\n- Login/Register page tests (AuthToggle, LoginForm, RegisterForm)\n- Home/Search page tests (SearchBar, CategoryFilter, PropertyGrid, PropertyCard, FavoriteButton, FiltersPanel, Pagination)\n- Property Detail page tests (ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard)\n- Test cases include initial state, actions, expected outcomes, edge cases, and repeated use scenarios\n\n#### **src/App.tsx**\n```typescript\nimport { Routes, Route } from 'react-router-dom'\nimport Login from './pages/Login'\nimport Home from './pages/Home'\nimport PropertyDetail from './pages/PropertyDetail'\nimport MyTrips from './pages/MyTrips'\nimport HostDashboard from './pages/HostDashboard'\nimport Profile from './pages/Profile'\nimport WriteReview from './pages/WriteReview'\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Routes>\n      <Route path=\"/login\" element={<Login />} />\n      <Route path=\"/\" element={<Home />} />\n      <Route path=\"/properties/:id\" element={<PropertyDetail />} />\n      <Route path=\"/trips\" element={<MyTrips />} />\n      <Route path=\"/trips/:bookingId/review\" element={<WriteReview />} />\n      <Route path=\"/hosting\" element={<HostDashboard />} />\n      <Route path=\"/profile\" element={<Profile />} />\n    </Routes>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default App\n```\n\n#### **src/store.ts**\n```typescript\nimport { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit'\nimport authReducer from './slices/authSlice'\nimport propertiesReducer from './slices/propertiesSlice'\nimport favoritesReducer from './slices/favoritesSlice'\nimport amenitiesReducer from './slices/amenitiesSlice'\nimport propertyDetailReducer from './slices/propertyDetailSlice'\nimport bookingsReducer from './slices/bookingsSlice'\nimport hostReducer from './slices/hostSlice'\nimport userReviewsReducer from './slices/userReviewsSlice'\nimport reviewFormReducer from './slices/reviewFormSlice'\n\nexport const store = configureStore({\n  reducer: {\n    auth: authReducer,\n    properties: propertiesReducer,\n    favorites: favoritesReducer,\n    amenities: amenitiesReducer,\n    propertyDetail: propertyDetailReducer,\n    bookings: bookingsReducer,\n    host: hostReducer,\n    userReviews: userReviewsReducer,\n    reviewForm: reviewFormReducer,\n  },\n})\n\nexport type RootState = ReturnType<typeof store.getState>\nexport type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch\n```\n\n#### **src/index.css**\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme {\n  --color-primary: #FF5A5F;\n  --color-primary-dark: #E04E52;\n  --color-primary-light: #FF787C;\n  --color-bg: #FFFFFF;\n  --color-bg-secondary: #F7F7F7;\n  --color-text: #222222;\n  --color-text-secondary: #717171;\n  --color-border: #DDDDDD;\n  --color-border-dark: #B0B0B0;\n  --color-error: #C13515;\n  --color-success: #008A05;\n  --color-warning: #E07912;\n  --color-status-pending: #F0AD4E;\n  --color-status-confirmed: #5CB85C;\n  --color-status-cancelled: #D9534F;\n  --color-status-completed: #5BC0DE;\n}\n\n* {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen,\n    Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n  color: var(--color-text);\n  background-color: var(--color-bg);\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n```\n\n#### **src/main.tsx**\n```typescript\nimport { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { Provider } from 'react-redux'\nimport { BrowserRouter } from 'react-router-dom'\nimport { store } from './store'\nimport App from './App'\nimport './index.css'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <Provider store={store}>\n      <BrowserRouter>\n        <App />\n      </BrowserRouter>\n    </Provider>\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n--